    [38;5;153mgetCurrentUser[39m catches read errors and returns [38;5;153mnull[39m.
  - If someone calls [38;5;153msaveSession[39m without a [38;5;153muserId[39m, it throws. That's a programming error and should show up immediately,
    not leave a half-written session behind.

